{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c68d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a85a-8231-76e1-8427-bd6f7a784205"},"sequence":417,"recorded_at":1780531400000829,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"4d662671-1b40-4c4a-ba35-517ccb03377e","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"4d662671-1b40-4c4a-ba35-517ccb03377e","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"4d662671-1b40-4c4a-ba35-517ccb03377e"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a85b-22b2-7f60-9e99-1c12310f1ead"},"task_id":"01a0a85b-22b2-7f60-9e99-1c12310f1ead","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a85b-22b2-7f60-9e99-1c12310f1ead","chunk":"Read text file `.spec/management-window.md`.\n1|# Management window\n2|\n3|## Goal\n4|\n5|Native 760×540 \"Раннеры и настройки\" window alongside the existing ~400pt menu.\n6|Menu stays fully functional; window adds GitHub + settings depth.\n7|\n8|## Entry\n9|\n10|- Reopen app (`applicationShouldHandleReopen`) and menu button \"Раннеры и\n11|  настройки…\" open the window via `Notification openManagementWindow`\n12|  (no new app delegate).\n13|- First launch shows the window once (`hasShownWelcome`).\n14|\n15|## Tabs\n16|\n17|- **Раннеры**: Mac name + `N из M включено`, `RunnerCard` list in scroll,\n18|  per-row errors, \"Включить все\" / \"Выключить все…\", offline note. Reuses\n19|  `Runners.State` and `RunnerCard`; no GitHub-gated controls.\n20|- **GitHub**: disconnected (server field + \"Войти через GitHub\" + Keychain\n21|  note), requesting/verifying (progress), awaitingUser (large code +\n22|  Copy/Open/Cancel + expiry/interval), connected (`@user`, host, last sync,\n23|  Refresh/Logout/Revoke, installations picker, repo checklist, grant-access),\n24|  failed (message + retry per `RetryKind` + offline note). Drives production\n25|  `GitHubAuth.Effect` via `ManagementWindowContainer`.\n26|- **Основные**: launch-at-login (`SMAppService.mainApp`, distinct from CI),\n27|  version + Sparkle check/auto toggles, quit (warns if CI running, never\n28|  stops CI).\n29|\n30|## Rules\n31|\n32|- Container maps state → props/reactions; Page is pure. Local `@State`\n33|  only for server-host text and tab selection.\n34|- GitHub failures never disable local toggles. Stale data is labeled with\n35|  last-sync time; `busy=false` older than 60s is not proof of idle.\n36|- Stop always confirms; per-row `changing` blocks only that row.","final_result":true}}}
