{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c695","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a85a-8231-76e1-8427-bd6f7a784205"},"sequence":421,"recorded_at":1780531400000837,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"4d662671-1b40-4c4a-ba35-517ccb03377e","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"4d662671-1b40-4c4a-ba35-517ccb03377e","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"4d662671-1b40-4c4a-ba35-517ccb03377e"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a85b-221b-7d63-b89c-0561373e8438"},"task_id":"01a0a85b-221b-7d63-b89c-0561373e8438","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a85b-221b-7d63-b89c-0561373e8438","chunk":"Read text file `.spec/runner-removal.md`.\n1|# Runner removal (in scope for this release)\n2|\n3|## Two operations (never confused)\n4|\n5|1. **Убрать из приложения**: deletes only the catalog entry (directory\n6|   record). Warns if the service keeps running. Deletes no files, no GitHub\n7|   registration, no certificates. Implemented with the catalog slice\n8|   (TASK-260916-304bw2).\n9|2. **Удалить runner из GitHub**: separate future scenario using\n10|   registration/remove tokens. Not the same button; requires explicit scope\n11|   and confirmation.\n12|\n13|## Rules\n14|\n15|- Removing from the app never stops, unregisters, or deletes the working\n16|  installation.\n17|- A removed-then-readded directory reuses discovery validation\n18|  (canonical path dedupe, no double import via symlink).\n19|- UI copy must name which operation runs; destructive GitHub removal needs\n20|  typed confirmation and shows the exact scope/registration ID.","final_result":true}}}
