ote\\n  logout                 Remove active user's token for current remote\\n  m                      Execute a mutation (write operation)\\n  migrate-keychain       Import legacy remote credentials into macOS Keychain\\n  migrate-project-config Preview or apply guarded deprecated project-config alias migration\\n  plan                   Show execution plan with phases and critical path\\n  q                      Query the board with a mini DSL\\n  repair-links           List or remove unsupported container dependency links\\n  resource               Upload, update, download, and delete board resources\\n  self-update            Update task-board to the latest version\\n  session                Inspect and stop Task-board Session Manager sessions\\n  spawn                  Queue an agent spawn run for a board task\\n  switch-user            Switch active user for current remote\\n  tree                   Show board as hierarchical tree\\n  tui                    Launch interactive TUI\\n  validate               Validate board structure\\n  whoami                 Show current remote and active user\\n  worktree               Inspect and repair managed Story workspaces\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\nExecute a write operation against the board using the DSL.\\n\\nMutations:\\n  set_status(ID, status=..., commit_ack=scope_committed?)\\n                                        Change status; acknowledge enforced done transitions\\n  normalize_legacy_status(ID, expected_raw=..., status=...)\\n                                        Repair one exact unparseable raw status (local boards)\\n  handoff(ID, role=..., status=...)     Verify checklist/outcome evidence and change status\\n  set_estimate(ID, estimate=..., ...)  Set Task/Bug story-point estimate\\n  create(type=..., name=..., ...)      Create element\\n  set_details(ID, title=..., ...)      Update README fields\\n  rename(ID, name=...)                 Rename element name/slug\\n  delete(ID)                           Delete element (destructive)\\n  assign(ID, agent=...)                Assign agent\\n  unassign(ID)                         Remove assignment\\n  link(ID, blocked_by=...)             Add dependency\\n  unlink(ID, blocked_by=...)           Remove dependency\\n  check_item(ID, item=N)              Check checklist item\\n  uncheck_item(ID, item=N)            Uncheck checklist item\\n  add_checklist_item(ID, text=...)     Add checklist item\\n  remove_checklist_item(ID, item=N)    Remove obsolete checklist item (destructive)\\n  set_notes(ID, text=..., set=bool?)   Append/set notes\\n  set_parent(ID, parent=...)           Move to new parent\\n  accept_cr(ID, revision=N, evidence=...) Record a reviewer acceptance of a Change Request revision (local board only)\\n  withdraw_cr(ID, revision=N, reason=...) Retire an unintegrated revision (local board only)\\n  defer_cr(ID, revision=N, reason=...)    Mark an accepted revision deferred by human decision (local board only)\\n  undefer_cr(ID, revision=N)              Clear the deferral marker (local board only)\\n  add_resource(ID, name=..., content=..., type=..., description=...)\\n  update_resource(ID, name=..., content=..., type=..., description=...)\\n  delete_resource(ID, name=...)        Delete resource (destructive)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4422,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1106,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
